#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs:38
msgid "Web Remote"
msgstr "Vefstýring"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs:40
msgid ""
"Turn on to control this player from a phone or tablet on the same network. "
"HTTP is not encrypted: use only a trusted private network. Scan the QR code "
"with the phone's camera to open the remote."
msgstr ""
"Kveiktu til að stjórna þessum spilara úr síma eða spjaldtölvu á sama neti. "
"HTTP er ekki dulritað: notaðu aðeins traust einkanet. Skannaðu QR-kóðann með "
"myndavél símans til að opna fjarstýringuna."

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs:47
msgid "Enable web remote"
msgstr "Virkja vefstýringu"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs:52
msgid "QR code"
msgstr "QR-kóði"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs:65
#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs:157
msgid "Web remote is off."
msgstr "Vefstýring er óvirk."

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs:83
msgid "KDE Connect / GSConnect"
msgstr "KDE Connect / GSConnect"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs:85
msgid ""
"If you have KDE Connect (Plasma, Android) or GSConnect (GNOME) installed, "
"your paired phone already shows media controls, track information and volume "
"for this player - no extra setup is required on our side."
msgstr ""
"Ef þú ert með KDE Connect (Plasma, Android) eða GSConnect (GNOME) uppsett "
"sýnir pöraði síminn þinn nú þegar miðlastýringar, upplýsingar um lag og "
"hljóðstyrk fyrir þennan spilara — engin viðbótaruppsetning er nauðsynleg af "
"okkar hálfu."

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs:92
msgid "Install KDE Connect on your phone"
msgstr "Settu upp KDE Connect í símanum þínum"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs:94
msgid ""
"Open the link on the phone's app store. Pair once - then media keys, "
"notifications and file sharing work both ways."
msgstr ""
"Opnaðu tengilinn í appaverslun símans. Paraðu einu sinni — eftir það virka "
"miðlalyklar, tilkynningar og skráadeiling í báðar áttir."

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs:98
msgid "Open KDE Connect download page"
msgstr "Opna niðurhalssíðu KDE Connect"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs:143
msgid "Scan the code with the phone's camera."
msgstr "Skannaðu kóðann með myndavél símans."

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs:149
msgid "Could not start server"
msgstr "Ekki var hægt að ræsa netþjón"
